===Verb===
{{en-verb|snaffles|snaffling|snaffled}}

# to put on, or control with, a snaffle
# to [[grab]] or [[seize]]; to [[snap up]]
# {{context|informal|lang=en}} to [[purloin]], or [[obtain]] by [[devious]] means

